      "source": "Also supports \"java.lang.String[]\"-style array class names, in contrast to the\nstandard <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#forName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.forName(String)</code></a> method.",
